PaymentRails_Receive
├── when value is zero
│   ├── it should succeed
│   └── it should not emit NativeReceived
├── when value is sent with call
│   ├── it should increase the native balance by the value
│   └── it should emit NativeReceived with sender and value
├── when value is sent with transfer
│   └── it should accept the value within the 2300 gas stipend
├── when value is sent with send
│   └── it should accept the value within the 2300 gas stipend
├── when calldata is non-empty
│   └── it should revert
└── fuzz
    └── when any non-zero value is sent
        └── it should hold exactly the value
